title: Analytics › The four tiles
route: /analytics
intro: Four tinted tiles, each with a big number, a label and two small lines: what the number means, and how many decisions, denials, requests or drafts are behind it. The tiles are not buttons.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Read the row of four tiles"
screen sc "Each tile\nBig number, label in capitals, a meaning line, then 'N decisions · this quarter'"

group gA "'Approved as asked' (green)"
  screen a1 "71%\n'▲ 6 pts vs last quarter'\n'1,070 decisions · this quarter'"
  process a2 "Share of decisions approved as asked in the period\nOne payer: that payer's own rate"
  decision a3 "Change against the period before?"
  toast a4 "'▲ 6 pts vs last quarter' (up, 'pt' for one point)"
  toast a5 "'▼ 2 pts vs last quarter' (down)"
  toast a6 "'No change vs last quarter'"
endgroup

group gB "'Top denial cause' (red)"
  screen b1 "29%\n'Thin continued-stay evidence'\n'311 denials · this quarter'"
  process b2 "Share of denials held by the biggest reason listed in the denial table\nThe line is a short name of that reason"
endgroup

group gC "'Advice taken works' (amber)"
  screen c1 "84%\n'Approved when applied'\n'828 requests · this quarter'"
  process c2 "Share approved among requests where the agents' advice was applied"
endgroup

group gD "'Sent without edits' (grey)"
  screen d1 "75%\n'As written, or a typo fixed'\n'966 drafts · this quarter'"
  process d2 "Share of agent drafts sent as written, or with a typo fixed"
endgroup

decision q1 "Fewer than 20 behind the figure?"
screen h1 "Number becomes '-'\nMeaning line reads 'Not enough decisions yet'\nThe count line stays, for example '17 requests · this quarter'"
screen ok "The number and its lines show as usual"
process p1 "Tiles do nothing when clicked or hovered\nUnlike the Eligibility tiles, they are not filters"
endx e1 "To change a tile, change the period or payer menu"
end e2 "Figures read"

s1 --> sc
sc --> a1 & b1 & c1 & d1
a1 --> a2 --> a3
a3 -->|Up| a4
a3 -->|Down| a5
a3 -->|Same| a6
b1 --> b2
c1 --> c2
d1 --> d2
a4 & a5 & a6 & b2 & c2 & d2 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| h1 --> e2
q1 -->|No| ok --> e2
sc -.-> p1 --> e1
